<title>FINLAND: HK-RUOKATALO 1996 PROFIT FALLS 7.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>HK-RUOKATALO 1996 PROFIT FALLS 7.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dcember 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    29.6 vs 32.0</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,347 vs 2,433</p>
<p> Operating profit				  87.1 vs 90.2</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    20.0 vs 15.1</p>
<p>Full name of Finnish food group is HK-Ruokatalo Oy.</p>
